Apollo Mission Control Operations & Tools Console
Provides interactive tabbed GUI panel for:
  1) AV & Mission Capture (Screenshots, Screen Video Recording, Audio/Keystroke toggles, Media Access)
  2) System Tools & Recovery (Btrfs Snapshots, Opt-In Autonomous Recovery, Multi-Engine AI Diagnostics)
  3) Multi-Monitor Display Radar (Live topology, Extend, Mirror, Solo, Docked presets)
Strict dark chassis & zero-white-background theme adherence across all 4 mission profiles.
"""
